  "status": "Local SDK22 repository installation, runtime and SDK tests pass on all three distributions. Native signed OBS qualification remains required.",
  "root_cause": "AmqpUtil captures XML during AOT compilation. The original RPM carried only a BuildRequires on XML; the Qore RPM generator provides core ABI/version requirements, not external module dependencies. A minimal installation therefore could not load AmqpUtil.",
  "fix": "Declare native qore-xml-module >= 1.0 in Requires and BuildRequires. Preserve optional source-module behavior. The repository solver installs XML when only AMQP and GEOS are requested.",
  "runner": "The signed installed-package runner accepts AMQP fixtures, requires XML in the runtime phase, runs the installed offline fixture and adds the qcc consumer after SDK installation.",
